@* What a player sees on a GM's page they reached by address (3.32). One component, because the
   same refusal was four screens: a lock card on two pages and a blue info bar on two others. The
   page says in a sentence why it is the GM's; the API refuses the data regardless. *@

<MudPaper Elevation="0" Class="nornis-card nornis-card-pad nornis-comingsoon nornis-gm-only">
    <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Outlined.Lock" Size="Size.Large" Class="nornis-comingsoon-icon" />
    <MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Class="nornis-serif">GMs only</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="nornis-comingsoon-text mt-2">@ChildContent</MudText>
</MudPaper>

@code {
    /// <summary>Why this page is the GM's, in a sentence.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public RenderFragment ChildContent { get; set; } = null!;
}
